    "platform": "CHIME",
    "description": "CHIME-like dataset for multiple sites and acquisition conditions, replicating the spectral configuration and spatial characteristics of the CHIME sensor. The workflow includes spectral harmonization of multispectral Level-2 reflectance data to the CHIME contiguous band set (0.40\u20132.50 \u03bcm, ~200 bands), followed by spatial harmonization to a 30 m product resolution.",
