    "processing:lineage": "Mimicked data produced by the University of Pavia Telecommunications & Remote Sensing Laboratory using:  EnMAP data under license from DLR using modified EnMAP data \u00a9 DLR. ECOSTRESS multispectral thermal infrared radiometer data (https://ecostress.jpl.nasa.gov/)."
